title: "wifi-csi-quality-har: Quality-aware gated CNN-LSTM for Wi-Fi CSI human activity recognition"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Türkay"
    given-names: "Yavuz"
keywords:
  - Wi-Fi sensing
  - channel state information
  - human activity recognition
  - irregular sampling
  - domain shift
  - calibration
abstract: >-
  Code, configurations, and aggregate results for the study "Quality-Aware Gated CNN-LSTM
  for Robust Wi-Fi CSI Human Activity Recognition: Cross-Dataset Evidence from CSI-Bench
  and XRF55": harmonized four-class protocol, impairment simulation with per-step quality
  channels, gated CNN-LSTM training, out-of-distribution, leave-one-out, external (XRF55),
  and ablation evaluations.
